00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,028
Watch it happen.

2
00:00:01,028 --> 00:00:04,882
Warm the cold junction from zero up to one hundred degrees.

3
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:14,335
The neutral temperature stays fixed at two fifty, but the inversion point slides down, always as far beyond two fifty as the cold junction is below it.

